## Summary Table for Bug Bounty Submissions
When writing up bugs on platforms like HackenProof, use this quick checklist to categorize your findings accurately:

| If You Discover This Condition | Categorize Your Report As |
|---|---|
| Swapping user IDs in a REST path loads someone else's data | BOLA / IDOR |
| Accessing internal data fields via nested GraphQL paths | Broken Field-Level Authorization |
| Injecting dynamic references (<!ENTITY>) into a SOAP body | XML External Entity (XXE) |
| Forcing a memory or script execution via gRPC streams | Insecure Deserialization / Buffer Overflow |

